00:01:06,626 --> 00:01:07,675
Here's the plan.

12
00:01:07,675 --> 00:01:12,328
First, the problem: why the embeddings from chapter nine aren't enough.

13
00:01:12,328 --> 00:01:16,981
Then three analogies that build intuition for queries, keys and values.

14
00:01:16,981 --> 00:01:21,634
Then the core: self-attention in five steps, with shapes at every line.

15
00:01:21,634 --> 00:01:25,369
Then causal masking, which stops the model from cheating.

16
00:01:25,369 --> 00:01:29,564
Then we go from one head to twelve heads with the reshape trick.

17
00:01:29,564 --> 00:01:37,297
Then we assemble a full transformer block with the feed forward network, layer normalisation and residual connections.

18
00:01:37,297 --> 00:01:50,076
