Cell thirty six: trace shapes for d model five twelve with eight heads and sequence ten.

540
00:48:07,324 --> 00:48:12,680
The projection gives fifteen thirty six, heads give eight by ten by sixty four.

541
00:48:12,680 --> 00:48:23,594
Cell thirty eight: compare one head and twelve heads, both should have two million three hundred fifty nine thousand two hundred ninety six attention parameters.

542
